# Enterprise page design (mandatory)

Full guide: `docs/enterprise-page-design-guide.md`

Lenix is an **enterprise production platform**, not an MVP or startup landing page. All marketing/product page UI and copy changes must follow this rule.

## Before writing code or copy

1. **Define page purpose** — primary user, primary action, what must not be promised
2. **Research** — web search for target users, their problems, and how similar enterprise products address them; do not rely on generic AI assumptions
3. **Map problems → Lenix** — one specific platform response per problem; omit or bound claims we cannot support
4. **Read existing page** — components + `messages/en/*.json` for that route
5. **Voice reference** — `messages/en/common.json` → `Home.Hero`, `Home.Pillars`, `Home.Merchant`

## Visual system

- **Default:** `home` from `@/lib/home-styles` + `HomeSectionHeader`
- **Forensic/recovery flows only:** `glass` from `@/lib/recovery-styles` — do not mix systems on one page without reason
- **Reuse homepage patterns** — text hero, pillars grid, merchant split (max 2/page), 3-col workflow, wide banner, centered CTA
- **Never:** fake UI mocks, grid/glow heroes, pulsing orbs, decorative SVG dividers, identical 2-col sections repeated 4×, yellow headline splits, `rounded-full` glow CTAs, icon-circle feature grids

## Content (humanizer required)

- Read and apply `~/.agents/skills/humanizer/SKILL.md` on all new/edited user-facing copy
- **Operator voice:** specific, verb-led, honest about limits (see Home.Hero — no recovery guarantees)
- **Not startup pitch:** ban empty hype — “institutional-grade”, “seamless”, “leverage”, “revolutionary”, unverified SLAs/stats
- **Not robot template:** no UX placeholder copy (“select a capability to review delivery model”)
- Put copy in `messages/en/<page>.json`; register in `src/i18n/request.ts`
- CTAs: consistent — “Start a recovery case”, “Contact us”, “Learn more”

## Pre-ship

- Section layout variety on pages with 3+ sections
- Real `/assets/img/` images + alt text
- `npm run build` passes
- Pre-ship checklist in full guide §7

When unsure, match the **homepage** — not a crypto SaaS template.
